Usage of unreal-agent-tui attach:
  -client-state-directory string
    	private client-local draft/retry/view directory; defaults to XDG state (not session history)
  -runtime-directory string
    	existing private runtime directory; defaults to XDG_RUNTIME_DIR
  -session string
    	required hosted session ID
  -session-directory string
    	existing session directory; defaults to XDG state
  -theme string
    	client-local palette name or JSON path (default "turbo-vision")
